[
    {
        "type": "hero",
        "data": {
            "label": "About",
            "heading": "One developer. No *middlemen*.",
            "subtext": "I'm Chris, a web developer in the UK. I build Laravel applications and WordPress sites, add AI where it earns its place, and run Kritano, the website auditing platform I founded. The person you talk to is the person who writes the code.",
            "cta_label": "Start a project",
            "cta_url": "/contact",
            "cta_secondary_label": "See the work",
            "cta_secondary_url": "/work",
            "theme": "light"
        }
    },
    {
        "type": "text-section",
        "data": {
            "label": "Who I am",
            "heading": "I build the whole thing.",
            "theme": "light",
            "body": {
                "type": "doc",
                "content": [
                    {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "content": [
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "text": "Most of my career has been building web platforms. Astro, Next.js, Node.js, Postgres, Redis: the kind of work where you have to ship something that holds up under real load. Today most of it is "
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "text": "Laravel",
                                "marks": [
                                    {
                                        "type": "link",
                                        "attrs": {
                                            "href": "/services/laravel"
                                        }
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "text": " and "
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "text": "WordPress",
                                "marks": [
                                    {
                                        "type": "link",
                                        "attrs": {
                                            "href": "/services/wordpress"
                                        }
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "text": ". I started doing "
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "text": "AI work",
                                "marks": [
                                    {
                                        "type": "link",
                                        "attrs": {
                                            "href": "/services/ai"
                                        }
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "text": " in 2023, when the APIs got good enough to be the missing piece in systems I was already building."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "content": [
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "text": "When I say I'll integrate something with your CRM, I mean I'll build it. Not spec it for someone else. Not draw it on a slide. Build it, ship it, watch it, and fix it if it breaks."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "content": [
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "text": "I build my own products too. "
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "text": "Kritano",
                                "marks": [
                                    {
                                        "type": "link",
                                        "attrs": {
                                            "href": "/work/kritano-website-audits"
                                        }
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "text": " audits websites against more than 500 rules, and this site runs on "
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "text": "cg-cms",
                                "marks": [
                                    {
                                        "type": "link",
                                        "attrs": {
                                            "href": "/work/cg-cms"
                                        }
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "text": ", a CMS I wrote for Laravel. That shapes how I work for clients. I know what good looks like, because I check for it every day."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        }
    },
    {
        "type": "text-section",
        "data": {
            "label": "Why one person",
            "heading": "One person is the point.",
            "theme": "light",
            "body": {
                "type": "doc",
                "content": [
                    {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "content": [
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "text": "Agencies tend to run the same way. Someone senior sells it, a project manager translates it, someone junior builds it. By the time the work lands, three people have stood between you and whoever wrote the code."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "content": [
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "text": "Work with me and the person scoping the job is the person doing it. That means:"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "bulletList",
                        "content": [
                            {
                                "type": "listItem",
                                "content": [
                                    {
                                        "type": "paragraph",
                                        "content": [
                                            {
                                                "type": "text",
                                                "text": "Faster decisions.",
                                                "marks": [
                                                    {
                                                        "type": "bold"
                                                    }
                                                ]
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "type": "text",
                                                "text": " If a build choice needs your input, I ask you directly."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "listItem",
                                "content": [
                                    {
                                        "type": "paragraph",
                                        "content": [
                                            {
                                                "type": "text",
                                                "text": "Straight answers.",
                                                "marks": [
                                                    {
                                                        "type": "bold"
                                                    }
                                                ]
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "type": "text",
                                                "text": " Ask what the system is doing and you'll get a real answer, in as much technical detail as you want."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "listItem",
                                "content": [
                                    {
                                        "type": "paragraph",
                                        "content": [
                                            {
                                                "type": "text",
                                                "text": "Consistent work.",
                                                "marks": [
                                                    {
                                                        "type": "bold"
                                                    }
                                                ]
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "type": "text",
                                                "text": " One person writing the system means fewer places for quality to slip."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "content": [
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "text": "What you won't get is a 24/7 support desk or a team of twelve specialists. If you need those, you need an agency. For everything else, one person is faster and cleaner."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        }
    },
    {
        "type": "text-section",
        "data": {
            "label": "How I work",
            "heading": "Four steps. No theatre.",
            "theme": "light",
            "body": {
                "type": "doc",
                "content": [
                    {
                        "type": "orderedList",
                        "content": [
                            {
                                "type": "listItem",
                                "content": [
                                    {
                                        "type": "paragraph",
                                        "content": [
                                            {
                                                "type": "text",
                                                "text": "Look.",
                                                "marks": [
                                                    {
                                                        "type": "bold"
                                                    }
                                                ]
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "type": "text",
                                                "text": " I start with what you've got: the site, the code, the process. For a website that usually means an audit, so the work goes where it makes a difference."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "listItem",
                                "content": [
                                    {
                                        "type": "paragraph",
                                        "content": [
                                            {
                                                "type": "text",
                                                "text": "Scope.",
                                                "marks": [
                                                    {
                                                        "type": "bold"
                                                    }
                                                ]
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "type": "text",
                                                "text": " We agree what to build first, and I write it down: what it does, what done looks like, and roughly how long it'll take."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "listItem",
                                "content": [
                                    {
                                        "type": "paragraph",
                                        "content": [
                                            {
                                                "type": "text",
                                                "text": "Build.",
                                                "marks": [
                                                    {
                                                        "type": "bold"
                                                    }
                                                ]
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "type": "text",
                                                "text": " Direct work, with tests, in small releases you can try as they land. No status meetings for the sake of them."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "listItem",
                                "content": [
                                    {
                                        "type": "paragraph",
                                        "content": [
                                            {
                                                "type": "text",
                                                "text": "Hand over.",
                                                "marks": [
                                                    {
                                                        "type": "bold"
                                                    }
                                                ]
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "type": "text",
                                                "text": " Deployed, documented and yours. Then we look at what changed and decide whether there's a next step."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        }
    },
    {
        "type": "columns",
        "data": {
